{"doc_id":"REPORT-news_r-00871-00001","summaries":{"A":{"adequacy":2,"critical_unsupported":1,"critical_omission":1,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":1,"fluency":3,"utility":2,"evidence":["캐나다는 이 사고에 직접적 지분이 있다","전원 사망한 탑승객 중 63명이 캐나다 국적"],"reason":"The summary says Canada has no direct stake, but the source says it does. It also leaves out the US shoot-down suspicion and the 1988 incident background, so the main point is lost."},"B":{"adequacy":2,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":1,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":0,"fluency":2,"utility":2,"evidence":["미국은 이란과의 관계에서 88년을 잊지 못한다","당시 이란의 민간항공기를 미국 해군 이지스함이 ... 격추"],"reason":"It keeps the opening framing and Trump's remark. It ends with a circular sentence about 1988 and omits what happened in 1988 and the Canada and Rouhani points. The wording \"이라크에 미군 기지를\" is slightly off."},"C":{"adequacy":3,"critical_unsupported":1,"critical_omission":1,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":1,"fluency":4,"utility":3,"evidence":["캐나다는 이 사고에 직접적 지분이 있다","미국인 승객은 없었다"],"reason":"The Trump quote and the opening framing are accurate. It says Canada had no direct stake, which reverses the source, and it omits the 1988 background that explains the US stance."},"D":{"adequacy":1,"critical_unsupported":1,"critical_omission":1,"wrong_unit_qualifier":1,"entity_relation":1,"fluency":2,"utility":1,"evidence":["캐나다는 이 사고에 직접적 지분이 있다","290은 88년 미국의 이란 항공기 격추로 사망한 이란 국민의 숫자"],"reason":"It says Canada had no direct stake, which reverses the source. It also garbles the 1988 section and calls 290 \"the number of the plane\" when it is the number of people killed. It omits the US shoot-down of the Iranian plane."}}}
